{"id": "2346775", "name": "מד\"ר סדר ראשון מדויקת 2", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "quadraticInequalitySolver", "params": ["inq"], "body": "block([domain,D,x0,x1,x2,a,b,c,wz,v],v:listofvars(inq)[1],inq:ineqorder(inq), ls:lhs(inq), [a,b,c,wz]:[coeff(ls,v,2),coeff(ls,v,1),coeff(ls,v,0),is(op(inq)=op (1>=2))],\nD:b^2-4*a*c,x0:subst(v=0,ls) ,if D<0 then  if x0<0 then domain: ((v< 0) and (v>0)) else domain: ((v>=0) or (v<0)),\nx1: (-b+sqrt(D))/(2*a), x2:(-b-sqrt(D))/(2*a), [x1,x2]:sort([x1,x2], lambda([p,q], is(float(p)<float(q)))), if (D>=0) and (a>0) then if wz then domain:((v<= x1) or (v>=x2)) else domain: ((v< x1) or (v>x2)),\nif (D>=0) and (a<0) then if wz then domain:  ((x1<=v) and (v<= x2)) else domain:  ((x1<v) and (v<x2)),domain)"}], "questiontext": "<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>&nbsp;נתונה המד\"ר הבאה:</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\[{{CT:0}}\\]</p>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: rtl;\"><span style=\"font-size: 0.9375rem;\">א. מצאו פונקציה (פוטנציאל) \\(U(x,y)\\) המקיימת \\(U(x,\\hat{y}(x))=C\\) עבור \\(C\\) קבוע, כאשר&nbsp;\\(\\hat{y}\\) הוא פתרון למד\"ר הנתונה.</span></p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(U(x,y)=\\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]<br></p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: rtl;\">ב. מצאו את הקבוע \\(C\\) מסעיף קודם בהנחה שמתקיים \\(\\hat{y}({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}}\\) .&nbsp;</p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\"></p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(C=\\)[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]]</p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\">ג. מצאו את תחום ההגדרה של \\(\\hat{y}\\). הזינו את תשובתכם כביטוי לוגי בתבנית אחד הבאים (גם במקרה שתחום ההגדרה הוא כל x וגם במקרה שתחום ההגדרה הוא ריק):</p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(x&lt;= a \\text{ or } x&gt;= b, \\quad a&lt;=x \\text{ and }x&lt;= b\\)</p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">[[input:ans3]] [[validation:ans3]]<br></p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: rtl; text-align: right;\">ד. הפונקציה \\(U\\) והקבוע \\(C\\) מגדירים שתי פונקציות. אחת מהן היא \\(\\hat{y}\\). את השניה נסמן ב\\(\\tilde{y}\\) מצאו מה ערך הפונקציה \\(\\tilde{y}\\) בנקודה \\(x={{CT:1}}\\).</p>\n<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"direction: ltr; text-align: center;\">\\(\\tilde{y}({{CT:1}})=\\)[[input:ans4]] [[validation:ans4]]<br></p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 35, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 25, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "CsDivC:trigsimp(fullratsimp(expand(radcan(ans1/U))));\ncorrectU: emptyp(listofvars(CsDivC));\ncorrectCs: is(trigsimp(fullratsimp(expand(radcan(ans2-const*CsDivC))))=0)", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correctU", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">צדקת במציאת הפונקציה U</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "correctCs", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">צדקת בערך של הקבוע</p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">טעית בערך של הקבוע<br></p>"}}]}, {"name": "prt2", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(domainSol)))", "tans": "trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(ans3)))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt2-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "prt3", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(ans4)))", "tans": "trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(ytildex0)))", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt3-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["D", "D0", "U", "a1", "a2", "a3", "a4", "a5", "const", "domainSol", "ls", "ode", "x0", "y0", "ytildex0"], "nvariants": 5